      "content": "I am so hurt that you feel you have \"failed\" after trying help, but please remember that \"not better\" is not \"worse than suffering,\" and \"giving up\" yourself is the only way to end the pain *for you*, not to \"give up the self that can help you feel better.\"\nIt is okay to want a rest you feel you \"deserve,\" but \"giving up the self that can help you feel better\" is a \"self harm plan\" that \"you \"\n\nI need help\n.\nI",
